[TITLE]
Chlorine first-order bulk decay (one species)

[OPTIONS]
AREA_UNITS FT2
RATE_UNITS HR
SOLVER     RK5
TIMESTEP   300
RTOL       0.001
ATOL       0.0001

[SPECIES]
BULK CL2 MG

[COEFFICIENTS]
CONSTANT Kb 0.3

[PIPES]
RATE CL2 -Kb*CL2

[TANKS]
RATE CL2 -Kb*CL2

[QUALITY]
GLOBAL CL2 0.0
NODE J1 CL2 1.2
NODE NOWHERE CL2 0.5

[REPORT]
SPECIES CL2 YES
